    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddd8 No levels. No noise. No pressure.</strong><br>Just space to think \u2014 and time to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa7 Study With Me: Lofi Vibes</strong><br>This isn\u2019t trying to entertain you. It\u2019s here to quietly support you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 What You\u2019ll Find Inside:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A steady lofi soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calm companion who works beside you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple focus tools: Pomodoro, Deep Work, Free Study</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time tracking that helps you build lasting habits</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u274c What You Won\u2019t Find:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pop-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No feeds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing flashy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Just Focus.</strong><br>A quiet place that helps you stay with what matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're ready to focus \u2014 really focus \u2014 you're in the right place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830160/extras/832a7a87a36659c2a6de6608acefc05e.avif?t=1754147676\" width=1600 height=1200 /></span></p>",
